# 17. x/
[Module]          [Packages]
.xinitrc          xorg xorg-xinit xorg-drivers(https://archlinux.org/groups/x86_64/xorg-drivers/) i3(*)
.xprofile         qt5ct qt6ct nvim(*) kitty(*) firefox libinput-tools feh networkmanager flameshot dunst rofi-greenclip(a) picom(*)
.Xresources       gtk3 gtk4 nwg-look qt5ct qt6ct sassc libadwaita arandr gamepad-tool-bin(a) (theme, icons, cursor mentioned in file)

# 18. zsh/
